  "description": "YDotNet.UnitOfWork implements the Unit of Work pattern for maintaining data consistency in .NET applications. It provides a robust way to manage database transactions and ensure data integrity. Features include:\n\n- Atomic transaction management\n- Entity Framework Core integration\n- Async/await support\n- Repository pattern integration\n- Transaction scoping\n- Automatic rollback on failure",
